; The TextMate backend. It reads a [Facts.t] and a [Scopes.t] and writes
; JSON, so it is a peer of the OCaml emitter.
;
; yojson is here and nowhere else, so lingo_editors is a package of its own.
; A consumer who links a generated parser keeps yojson out of the build
; graph.

(library
 (name textmate)
 (public_name lingo_editors.textmate)
 (libraries lingo.core lingo.scopes redfa yojson))
